8	 * Derives the owner's {@code householdSize} at response time: the number of owners sharing this
9	 * owner's {@link Owner#getHouseholdId() householdId}, counting this owner itself. An owner with no
10	 * household id is a household of one. The size is exposed as a derived, response-time field on the
11	 * owner.
12	 *
